  "id": "DOC-20-T5c819",
  "title": "Text: DET Al Avila ↔ Anthony Fenech",
  "date": "2020-05-11",
  "from": "DET Al Avila",
  "to": "Anthony Fenech",
  "type": "text",
  "subjects": [],
  "content": [
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:57 PM",
      "text": "Trivia question: Who was the first player Al Avila acquired via trade as Tigers GM?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:57 PM",
      "text": "Don’t look it up"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Al Avila",
      "time": "4:00 PM",
      "text": "Maybin I think"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "4:09 PM",
      "text": "❌"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "4:10 PM",
      "text": "Randy Wolf"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Al Avila",
      "time": "4:12 PM",
      "text": "Correct. We needed a pitcher for innings and we got him for $1.00"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Al Avila",
      "time": "4:12 PM",
      "text": "It was a bargain"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "4:13 PM",
      "text": "Your next video meeting with your guys, you should see who can get the answer"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "4:13 PM",
      "text": "I thought Maybin, too. Or K-Rod. But those were in the off-season"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Al Avila",
      "time": "4:18 PM",
      "text": "Yes and Justin Wilson. Will do. Should be cool."
    }
  ]
}